                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "​Sentinel 3: Homeworld is an absolute classic that defines pure tactical brilliance. Long before mobile gaming became oversaturated, this game showed everyone how a proper Tower Defense should be made.\n​🎯 What Made It Special?\n​The Commander Unit: Having a customizable, deployable hero unit on the battlefield added an incredible layer of strategy and active defense.\n​Deep Upgrades & Arsenal: Balancing energy turrets, devastating orbital strikes, and managing your economy across intense waves kept you on the edge of your seat.\n  \n​ Sci-Fi Atmosphere: The sleek futuristic design, intense alien onslaughts, and pumping soundtrack made every level an epic struggle for survival.\n​Final Verdict:\nA timeless legend of the genre. If you want pure nostalgia and strategic depth, Sentinel 3 is still a masterclass.",
